OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry and settled night with light
OL,7,Fwinds. Mostly cloudy skies, though
OL,8,Fsome clear intervals are possible.
OL,9,FChilly in places with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA dry and mostly cloudy
OL,12,Fmorning with brightness at times.
OL,13,FCloud lowering and becoming thicker in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon, fog patches and drizzle
OL,15,Fby evening. Winds strengthening
OL,16,Fthrough the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
